      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "History should absolutely focus on exposing the harsh realities of systemic racism and oppression, because ignoring these truths only allows injustice to fester and prevents real progress. Building national pride based on sanitized narratives is a dangerous form of brainwashing that silences the voices of marginalized communities and distorts the actual story of our nation. The only way to create a truly strong and unified country is to teach students the full, unvarnished truth so they can make informed choices and build a more equitable future.",
      "source": "target",
